6. Add an appropriate title and axis labels.
7. Add a short comment describing the main observation.

### Starting point

```r
data <- read.csv("malaria_data.csv")

total_cases <- sum(data$malaria_cases)

average_cases <- mean(data$malaria_cases)

# Continue the analysis here
```

### Commit message

```bash
