# Pull Request Requirements

Each Pull Request should contain:

### Title

A clear description of the contribution.

Example:

```text
Add malaria trend analysis
```

### Description

Include:

- What was added
- Which research question was addressed
- Main finding
- Files changed

Example:

```text
## Summary

Added an analysis of weekly malaria case trends.

## Analysis

- Calculated total and average cases
- Identified the week with the highest cases
- Added a weekly case trend plot

## Main finding

The analysis identifies the week with the highest simulated malaria case count.
```

---

# After Contributions Are Merged

Once the Pull Requests have been merged into `main`, update the local repository:

```bash
git switch main
```

Then:

```bash
