# Git Workflow Summary

The basic collaborative workflow is:

```text
Clone
  ↓
Create branch
  ↓
Make changes
  ↓
Check status
  ↓
Review changes
  ↓
Stage changes
  ↓
Commit
  ↓
Push
  ↓
Pull Request
  ↓
Review
  ↓
Merge into main
  ↓
Pull latest changes
```

### Core commands

```bash
git status
git branch
git switch -c <branch>
git add .
git commit -m "message"
git push -u origin <branch>
